senses.gloss:
वृन्त वृन्त, अम्, n. (said to be fr. rt. वृ),
the footstalk of a leaf or fruit, a stalk; a nipple;
the stand of a water-jar.

वृन्दारक, अस्, अका or इका, अम्, much, great;
best, excellent, eminent, chief; respectable, venerable,
reputable; handsome, agreeable, beautiful, pleasing;
(अस्), m. a deity, immortal; a chief, the head or
leader of a crowd or herd &c.
